  "notes": "USAGE:\nCommonly used in political, social, and sports contexts. The base verb {支持|しじ}する means to support or endorse.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {熱心|ねっしん}な{支持者|しじしゃ} (enthusiastic supporter)\n- {支持者|しじしゃ}{集会|しゅうかい} (supporters' rally)\n- {支持者|しじしゃ}{離|ばな}れ (loss of supporters)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {応援者|おうえんしゃ}: cheerleader, supporter — more informal, often for sports or personal encouragement\n- {賛同者|さんどうしゃ}: endorser — someone who agrees with a specific proposal or opinion",
